WEBVTT

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.220
Good Doctor and Miss Sapphee,

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.490
please bear with us for a while.

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:17.940
Scythia Transportation will absolutely 
get you to your destination

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:20.750
safely and speedily!

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:27.350
What a coincidence that Miss Tisalia also 
had plans to go to the harpies' village.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:29.420
I guess it's nothing but 
smooth sailing from here...

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.350
or perhaps "smooth riding," since 
we're riding a carriage up a mountain.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:34.380
Yeah, she's a real lifesaver.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:39.170
But to think that octo-woman's demands 
would get this ridiculous...

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.940
I don't even have words anymore.

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:45.520
And we were just finally 
able to reopen our clinic.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:48.770
Well, I was pretty surprised by this, too.

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:52.400
I wasn't expecting her to suddenly send us 
to the harpies' village to do checkups.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:55.480
I do want to find out how <i>she's</i> doing, though.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:58.110
Illy, was it?

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:03.870
I heard that she was taken back to the 
village with the other girls, but has no family.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:08.790
According to Lady Cthulhy, she lost so 
many feathers that she can no longer fly.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.180
If that's true, we can't 
just sit by and do nothing.

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:21.600
This is my time to show how amazing I am

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.590
as a woman and get the doctor
to agree to marry me!

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:27.360
While your dedication is admirable...

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:29.930
You're all sweaty from 
climbing these mountains.

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:33.370
I'm not sure if men find that appealing.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.760
What is that?

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.490
My lady!

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:10.280
Miss Tisalia! Are you all right?

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:16.890
Y-Yes, I'm fine. Kay and Lorna shielded me.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:24.650
Kay?

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:38.590
Kay...

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:50.230
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:12.980
Case 5        The Centaur With a Sprain

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:13.770
There's no need to worry, my lady. 
This is nothing—

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.580
Doctor, will Kay be all right?

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:19.180
She may have sprained, 
or worse, fractured her leg.

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:23.700
Either way, we'd have to get to the 
village to do a proper examination.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:26.710
Kay... It's all my fault.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.450
There they are!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:36.420
We've come to escort you, Doctor Glenn 
and members of Scythia Transportation.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:37.900
Thank goodness.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.460
One of us has been injured.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:43.150
Can we ask you to carry her to the village?

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:44.970
That will not be a problem!

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:46.560
Let's go, men!

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:47.470
Right!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:54.530
Kay...

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:09.080
So this is the harpies' village.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.320
Doctor...

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:15.650
You can keep that on.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.870
Thank you for coming all this way.

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:24.770
He's the elder of this village.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.550
Nice to meet you.

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:29.770
I heard that someone in your 
company has been injured.

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:33.530
There have been some peculiar 
rumblings as of late.

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:35.640
I'm glad I sent my men to fetch you.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.840
Where's Miss Kay now?

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:40.000
We took her to the village's guest house.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.310
We had been preparing it for your stay,

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:47.510
so you can begin examining her immediately.

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:48.740
Thank you very much.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:52.160
We'll go see how Miss Kay is doing.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.620
What will you do, Miss Tisalia?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:58.000
I have some business to 
discuss with the elder.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:04.370
Lorna, please accompany the doctor. 
I'm worried about Kay.

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:06.880
As you wish, my lady.

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:15.880
It must be here.

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:18.480
As I thought, it's a sprain.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.430
Though it must hurt, 
we're lucky it's not a fracture.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:24.820
You need bed rest with a sprain this bad.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:27.740
I-If my leg isn't broken, I can walk.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.150
Ow!

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:34.350
If you move too much, 
it will only take longer to heal.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:38.580
As long as you stay put, all you'll need 
are some compresses and painkillers.

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:41.840
Thankfully, this village apparently 
has some hot springs.

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:44.790
I asked them to bring us 
some water from there.

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:47.280
Please just get some rest here.

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.590
But...

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:55.360
Don't trouble the good doctor, Kay.

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:59.980
I'll make sure our lady is taken 
care of during your absence.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:05.730
Then I shall treat this as some time off.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:08.240
I'm counting on you, Lorna.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.990
Of course! Leave it to me!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:21.260
That should do it.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.000
Thank you very much, Doctor.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:28.000
Crunch, crunch.

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:31.340
Vwoom.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.520
You're awfully popular, Doctor.

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:36.180
Well, it is the first day. 
I'm sure it'll eventually calm down.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:36.180
Crunch, crunch. Crunch, crunch.

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:38.230
Hopefully.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:40.670
Doctor!

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:46.570
Thank you for saving us back there.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.910
I'm glad you're all doing well.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.150
Um... Where's Illy?

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:55.270
She won't come out. She says 
she doesn't want to see you.

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.660
You're a lifesaver, Doctor!

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:11.260
Take care.

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:20.070
Miss Lorna.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.570
Oh... Hello, Doctor.

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.550
Why are you out here by yourself?

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:29.580
Oh, no. I'm not out here by 
myself. My lady is with me.

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:35.490
Um... I don't see Miss Tisalia.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:37.580
O-Oh?

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:43.290
Um... It appears we've gotten separated. 
Whatever will I do with her?

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:46.310
How is Kay doing?

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:48.240
She seems to be fine.

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:51.800
She's been sleeping and reading books 
back at our temporary clinic.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.890
The hot spring water seems to be working.

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:55.240
I see.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:09:02.310
It may be rude of me to ask, but what 
is your relationship with Miss Kay?

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:05.050
Oh, does that concern you?

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:10.230
We're both war orphans.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:13.350
War orphans?

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:14.320
Yes.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:18.480
Centaurs have a long history 
of being mercenaries,

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:21.920
so it is their custom to take in 
children who have lost their parents.

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:26.010
Those children are then raised 
as attendants or soldiers.

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:33.580
The ones who took us in were servants 
to the renowned Scythia family,

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:35.160
the Arte family.

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:41.420
Ever since that day, it has been the duty 
of Kay and myself to serve our lady.

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.600
Lorna!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.200
Oh, Doctor.

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:49.180
I do apologize for interrupting.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:52.600
Lorna, I've been looking for you everywhere.

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:55.570
What in the world are you doing here?

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.160
I was...

00:09:57.160 --> 00:10:00.480
I was just asking the 
doctor how Kay was doing.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:03.730
Where did you get lost, my lady?

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.000
What are you talking about?

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.900
You're the one who got lost.

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:11.120
You wandered off the second I looked away.

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:14.740
Huh? I-I couldn't have...

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:17.010
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:20.020
There's clearly something wrong with Lorna!

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:23.310
That Lorna...

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:28.600
Ever since we arrived here, 
she's become the very image of clumsiness.

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:30.430
She fetched me the wrong clothes,

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:32.690
she made a shaggy mess of my hair,

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:36.180
she used the wrong seasoning in her cooking...

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.820
and she cut her finger.

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:46.590
Because of that, I haven't 
had a decent meal since.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:49.630
Your cooking is delightful, Miss Sapphee!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.830
All I did was put dressing 
on some fresh vegetables...

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:52.830
May I have some more?

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:02.280
That's not all.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:06.680
She kept saying unthinkable things 
during our meeting with the elder.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:09.160
We've hardly gotten any work done.

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:10.610
Really?

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:13.300
By the way, what did you 
discuss with the elder?

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:17.930
Well, there have been talks within 
Scythia Transportation about branching out

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:21.570
and creating an air courier 
division specialized for speed.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:27.570
We're negotiating the possibility of 
employing harpies for that venture.

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:30.990
I see. That sounds like a great idea.

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:35.570
That could be ideal for delivering 
urgent messages and medicines.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:40.070
This is an extremely important matter,

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:46.210
and yet Kay has been injured, 
and Lorna has been acting strange.

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:51.170
Good Doctor, may I ask you 
to examine Lorna, as well?

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:53.390
Examine Miss Lorna?

00:11:55.270 --> 00:12:00.610
I'm assuming Miss Lorna is a bit absent-minded 
because she's worried about Miss Kay.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:03.330
I do believe that is the case!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:07.050
Then we may just have to wait 
until Miss Kay's sprain is better.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:10.580
I'll never last if we do that!

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:15.280
Kay and Lorna have always 
done everything for me!

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:19.020
I cannot fathom a life without attendants!

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:20.850
Just do things yourself.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.040
In that case...

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:27.710
I will give you the finest white wine made 
with grapes from the Aluloona Plantation.

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:32.320
It's a special vintage, of which 
only ten are made per year.

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:33.820
Let's help her immediately!

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:35.570
No, I insist! Please let us help her!

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:37.030
Sapphee, uh...

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:42.660
It's Aluloona white wine! One may never 
have a chance to drink it in their lifetime!

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.580
We must not let this chance escape!

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:47.940
Yeah, but there's nothing we can do...

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:49.270
Doctor.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.840
Kay, Lorna, and I

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:57.760
have grown up just like sisters 
since we were very young.

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:01.980
But in the end, we do have a 
master-and-servant relationship.

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:04.410
Even if there is something 
they cannot share with me,

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:07.130
I'm sure they could share it with each other.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:11.140
That's a part of their 
relationship I cannot enter.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.270
Miss Tisalia...

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:16.270
So please, Doctor.

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:19.110
Please... Help Lorna.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:25.340
I didn't bring too many 
medical books with me.

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:28.290
Do you think you'll be able 
to figure it out, Doctor?

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.410
No, not at all.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:34.420
Is this matter that difficult?

00:13:34.420 --> 00:13:36.420
I wouldn't say it's difficult.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:40.590
The reason that Miss Lorna is so 
absent-minded is because Miss Kay is hurt.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.040
That's really all there is to it.

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:48.270
The problem is that, while we may 
know the cause, we can't get rid of it.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:53.160
It's going to take a little while longer 
for Miss Kay's sprain to get better.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:57.600
Miss Kay seems just fine, 
despite being separated from Miss Lorna.

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:00.590
That's probably just a 
difference in personality.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:07.970
Centaurs are brave, and they 
are excellent warriors,

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:10.250
but they can also be quite high-strung

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:12.570
and even cowardly at times.

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:15.160
She might've inherited 
those characteristics.

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:21.130
Miss Lorna must be very sensitive.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.260
What's that?

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:32.520
Doctor, there's a way to 
deal with sensitive people.

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:34.330
Deal with them?

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:36.400
You're not talking about using drugs, are you?

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.770
This won't call for anything like that.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.150
If she's worried about what's 
going on around her...

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:45.140
We just need to trap her inside.

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:46.440
Trap her inside?

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.580
Aw, it's all gone.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:50.670
Vwoom.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:57.540
Let's see... Okay, here it is.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:01.030
"The maturing of centaurs, their education,

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:03.410
and how they deal with any 
ailments they may face"...

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:06.980
Doctor, what are you thinking of doing?

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:09.760
Miss Lorna is already a grown woman.

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:18.300
<i>Ever since we were little,</i>

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:20.430
<i>Kay was always by my side.</i>

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:23.170
<i>But to think...</i>

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:29.820
<i>that I'd become so useless just 
because Kay is not by my side.</i>

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:33.880
<i>What should I do? Will we be all right?</i>

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:38.900
<i>My lady will one day take 
over the Scythia family.</i>

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:41.240
<i>She must marry soon and produce an heir.</i>

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:45.990
<i>Yes, the doctor... He would 
be the perfect match.</i>

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.790
<i>Oh, I'm so anxious.</i>

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:51.090
<i>I wonder how long it'll take 
for Kay to get better.</i>

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:56.340
<i>Look at her, so at ease. 
Is she fine without me?</i>

00:15:56.810 --> 00:16:01.470
<i>I have to straighten up. It's all up to me.</i>

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:04.260
Miss Lorna.

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:11.530
Well?

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:14.000
Do you feel calmer?

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:17.370
Yes, Doctor.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.700
This is wonderful.

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:21.260
Yes... This is lovely.

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:23.720
Lorna, are you all right?

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:25.550
Yes, my lady.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.470
<i>Yes...</i>

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.630
<i>It's all quite simple.</i>

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:37.640
<i>What's important to me is 
what I can do for my lady.</i>

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:42.830
<i>That's what I promised Kay. 
That she could leave it to me.</i>

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.940
Seems like the blindfold worked.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:53.360
Yes, though I wasn't sure it'd be 
effective on Miss Lorna until we tried.

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:56.620
Just in case, let's try this, too.

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:01.360
<i>If all goes well, this could also prove useful.</i>

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:14.180
Please straighten up.

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:17.510
Yes, just like that.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:21.400
S-Sorry! Are you all right?

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:26.160
A-Actually, Doctor... 
you can make them even tighter.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:27.710
In fact, that might be better...

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:29.590
I-I see...

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:30.430
In that case...

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.160
Yes, Doctor... Right there...

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:37.560
Doctor, should I even ask 
what you're doing?

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:37.560
That's... perfect.

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:43.910
Oh, I'm realigning her bones 
to help improve her posture.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:49.290
Centaurs practice this from childhood 
to create their beautiful adult forms.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:53.160
Though I guess it's used for 
discipline in some cases, too.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.690
Discipline...

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.930
How are you feeling, Lorna?

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:00.710
Yes, I feel much calmer.

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:03.740
I don't have to think about 
anything unnecessary.

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.280
R-Really?

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:08.400
Yes. With my vision obscured, 
I feel a weight lifted off my chest.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.770
Now I can concentrate on you, my lady.

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:15.510
Apparently, it was quite effective.

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:16.910
This is just a guess,

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:20.990
but it could also be due to Miss Lorna's 
personality and... uh... interests.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:24.560
Are you suggesting that 
she likes to be tied up?

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:25.940
Um...

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:27.920
I'm not sure how to explain this.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.210
Doctor.

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:32.440
I do apologize for asking you to do all this.

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:35.220
But Lorna seems better now.

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:38.950
I thank you from the bottom of my heart.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:41.610
Say, Lorna.

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:43.080
Yes?

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:48.570
You previously consulted the 
doctor about my hooves, didn't you?

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:51.610
That made me very happy.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:56.650
Well, I still find being 
shod a bit frightening,

00:18:56.650 --> 00:19:01.440
but I could tell that you and 
Kay truly cared about me.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:04.150
Of course, my lady.

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:07.900
When you're happy, we're happy.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:12.080
I feel the same way about you two, as well.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:17.100
I love you both very much,

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:22.100
and I wish you both nothing but happiness.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:24.610
My lady...

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:33.730
Doctor, I was wondering...

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:40.100
Is Miss Tisalia going to walk around the 
harpies' village and negotiate with the elder

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:43.010
with Miss Lorna in that state?

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:43.740
Oh.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:46.340
Of course.

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:49.700
I shall follow you to the 
ends of the earth, my lady.

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:55.590
I never knew this was a 
hobby of yours, Lorna...

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:59.550
Kay, the good doctor did this for me.

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:03.420
If you're suggesting this is a hobby, 
I must say that it's actually the doctor's.

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:08.110
Oh, I see. Well, if you'd 
said something sooner...

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:08.770
Huh?

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:14.700
We haven't thanked you for tending to 
my wounds or helping Lorna yet, Doctor.

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:17.860
Oh, but Miss Tisalia has already paid me.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.530
Oh, that's nowhere near enough, is it?

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:26.000
Let us thank you properly.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.160
Feel free to do whatever you'd like.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.910
M-Miss Tisalia will get angry!

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.280
Actually, Sweet Doctor...

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:37.500
It's for her sake that we're doing this.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:45.730
In our culture, attendants are 
equal to a master's belongings.

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:48.810
If the master marries, 
their partner shares the wealth.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:52.100
Attendants then belong to both partners...

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.680
And the wife's attendants

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:55.950
must also serve her husband.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:01.440
If our lady marries you, Doctor...

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:06.820
That would make us your attendants, as well.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:10.830
Meaning we will also belong 
to you someday, Doctor.

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:15.990
So we wouldn't mind you having 
a little taste right now.

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:20.830
Considering how naïve our lady is, 
if we were to make something up...

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:27.210
You'd have to take responsibility for laying 
your hands on her attendants by marrying her.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.360
Miss Kay! Miss Lorna!

00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:36.080
Oh, come now. We were just teasing, Doctor.

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:38.340
Yes. Please don't take 
what we said seriously.

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:42.260
But please don't forget...

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:46.690
We will do anything we must for our lady.

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:51.120
We look forward to the day...

00:21:51.470 --> 00:21:54.500
...when you become our 
master, as well, Doctor.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Case 6       The Harpy Who Couldn't Fly

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:38.560
Case 6: "The Harpy Who Couldn't Fly."
